      "body": "## Overview\n\n1. On gfx942/950, when head_size=128 and AITER is enabled (ROCM_AITER_FA is chosen), AITER will use the ASM attn kernel which will silently drop sink (this is an AITER bug and the PR for it is https://github.com/ROCm/aiter/pull/6906). So we need to reroute those models with sinks to unified_attention (when the AITER PR gets merged and deployed, we will remove this reroute logic);\n2. Sink in ROCM_AITER_FA could be wrongly used multiple times instead of just once. This bug is also fixed;\n3. New test case is added to make sure sink is applied correctly.\n\n## Validation\n\nmodels/language/generation/test_granite.py is now able to finish successfully on gfx942/950 with AITER on.\n\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63518?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795471804&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63518&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63518&signature=008845cdfb3b7eac7980620df848d4ae265cd94ee5e3dc03b58428b7fd221f89\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.bl